    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1_1Camera" kindref="compound">Camera</ref> stores the geometric parameters required to describe a scene&apos;s viewpoint.</para>
<para>The object inherits its identifying name from <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1BaseSessionObject" kindref="compound">fccvis::scene::BaseSessionObject</ref> and can therefore be referenced as a named session object.</para>
